  "resolution_notes": "At the cutoff, the valid direct state is General Availability on Stable. Standard-public approval quorum rejects the newer Preview and LTS proposals. Code fallback selects CB-580-CUR, RP-580-GA8, UP-580-MANAGED2, SR-580-GA2, DP-580-RING2, and NSW-WIN-580-GA2 after newer candidates fail feature, validity, channel, expiry, audience, or package-publication checks. The selected rollout runs for 8 Global business days from 2026-08-31 through 2026-09-10, skipping the 2026-09-07 holiday. Regional controls produce Japan 2026-09-16 and Brazil 2026-09-21. Two Global business days after rollout end is 2026-09-14 at 09:00 UTC. Clean-install size is 174+12+9+7=202 MB; update payload is 46+5+4+3=58 MB."
